         - A Cyclic Forward Shift of the Pivot Atom from At1 to At2 Transforms Theta into 180 - Theta and Phi into Phi + 120.
         - A Change of the Sense Transforms Theta into 180 - Theta and Phi into 180 - Phi, and Vice Versa.

